#import "@local/ib:0.1.0": *
#title[#a[Podman Desktop][https://podman-desktop.io/]]
#a-badge[https://github.com/podman-desktop/podman-desktop]

- Multiple container engine support
  - #a[Podman container engine][https://github.com/containers/podman]
  - #a[crc][https://github.com/code-ready/crc]
  - #a[Lima: Linux Machines][https://github.com/lima-vm/lima]
  - #a[Docker container engine][https://github.com/docker/docker]

- Scoop: ```pwsh scoop install extras/podman-desktop```

  Doesn't include ```sh podman``` by default:
  ```pwsh scoop install main/podman```
